  "bio": "Renowned for her impeccable fineline tattoo artistry, Wlada Jurczanka is a master in crafting delicate and intricate designs. From her professional space in Wrocław, Poland, Wlada ensures that each client's experience is not only welcoming and friendly but also marked by an unrivaled level of cleanliness, reflecting her commitment to both artistry and hygiene. Her portfolio, adorned with slow, meticulously created tattoos, is a testament to her conscientious and client-focused approach.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wroclaw, Lower Silesian Voivodeship, Poland",
